# Everything else under results/ is a scratch log or a regenerable build product:
#   wwm_sandbox.html  6 MB   -> scripts/run_race.py
#   races.json        4 MB   -> scripts/run_race.py
#   *.gif            40 MB   -> base64 copies live in the sandbox template
#   _*.log, *.out           -> per-experiment scratch, superseded by docs/NOTES.md

